<title>JAPAN: Ube Industries - 6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Ube Industries - 6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		170.00	     170.00	     169.47</p>
<p> Current		2.00		 2.00	     361    million</p>
<p> Net		    2.00		 1.00		51    million</p>
<p>NOTE - Ube Industries Ltd is a manufacturer of chemicals and cement. The revision is due to an extraordinary profit stemming from sales of some of the shares it held in its unit Ube-Nitto Kasei Co.</p>
